flowchart TD
    accTitle: Shader representations and conversion
    accDescr: Scene shader code joins renderer templates. RD uses SPIR-V and backend containers, while GLES3 uses its own GL program compilation path.
    Scene[Engine shader code and material parameters] --> Language[Preprocessor language and compiler]
    Language --> RDTemplate[RD generated templates and ShaderRD variants]
    Language --> GLTemplate[GLES3 templates and ShaderGLES3]
    RDTemplate --> GLSL[Stage GLSL]
    GLSL --> Glslang[glslang module]
    Glslang --> SPIRV[SPIR-V and reflection]
    SPIRV --> VK[Vulkan container]
    SPIRV --> NIR[NIR then DXIL container]
    SPIRV --> Metal[SPIRV-Cross and Metal container]
    VK --> Pipeline[Native shader and pipeline creation]
    NIR --> Pipeline
    Metal --> Pipeline
    GLTemplate --> GL[GL compile and link]
